  "derivation": "Arm D of the map-corpus experiment. Round 898's protocol and the arm A brief, both unchanged. TWO author-observable inputs moved, unlike arms B and C which moved one: contract.txt, regenerated after R934 corrected the two surfaces that credited every completeness check to wiring containment (218 lines in both arms, 55,288 bytes in arm C against 56,509 here, four lines differing); and the seeded mnemosyne.toml, from which R934 removed the rules_path line that had made the rules filename a guess. The revision is the commit that lands these inputs, recorded at the run - a self-referential pin costs a second commit by construction, as v1, v2 and v3 each recorded.",
